1
00:00:00,949 --> 00:00:03,539
(Raj:)He just went colon, capital O.

2
00:00:06,371 --> 00:00:08,791
(Sheldon:)-You tampered with my experiment?
-We had to.

3
00:00:08,957 --> 00:00:12,957
(Raj:)It was the only way to keep you
from being such a huge Dickensian.

4
00:00:13,837 --> 00:00:16,677
You see that? I added the "ensian."

5
00:00:17,799 --> 00:00:19,549
(Sheldon:)Did Leonard know about this?

6
00:00:19,718 --> 00:00:22,508
(Sheldon:)Leonard's my best friend.
Surely Leonard didn't know.

7
00:00:22,679 --> 00:00:24,349
(Howard:)-It was his idea.
-Of course it was.

8
00:00:24,514 --> 00:00:26,644
(Sheldon:)The whole plan reeks of Leonard.

9
00:00:28,143 --> 00:00:30,103
(Penny:)-I missed you so much.
-I missed you too.

10
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:33,860
-I couldn't think of anyone else.
-Me neither.

11
00:00:34,691 --> 00:00:37,401
(Leonard:)Except for one night
when the heat went out.

12
00:00:38,862 --> 00:00:41,282
Long story. It's-- Don't ask.

13
00:00:42,449 --> 00:00:43,489
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

14
00:00:43,658 --> 00:00:46,118
SHELDON:
Leonard. Leonard. Leonard.

15
00:00:47,495 --> 00:00:50,835
[WHISPERS]
Do not make a sound.

16
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:54,046
SHELDON:
Whispering, "Do not make a sound"...

17
00:00:54,961 --> 00:00:58,021
(Sheldon:)...is a sound.

